WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.841
Native point clouds, checked against the released code.

00:00:04.841 --> 00:00:08.791
RGB and 3D decode from the same 64-channel latent.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:15.222
The claim, from GAE project page: Every generated latent decodes into appearance

00:00:15.222 --> 00:00:19.288
and 3D — without reconstructing geometry as an afterthought.

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:20.192
It holds.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.148
Takes the latent and nothing else; RGB only colours each point.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:32.677
30–65% how much generated geometry degrades against the same codec on real frames.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.972
Native, as claimed.

00:00:34.972 --> 00:00:38.487
The released weights reproduce none of the generation tables.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.858
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
